*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0001
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-07-17 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 585
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0001.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TXN-AMT            PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 COUNTRY-CD         PIC X(2).
       88 COUNTRY-IS-XC VALUE 'XC'.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 REVIEW-FLAG        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2000-CHECK-MINOR
    PERFORM HIGH-RISK-REGION
    DISPLAY "REVIEW-FLAG=" REVIEW-FLAG
    STOP RUN.
2000-CHECK-MINOR.
    IF CLNT-AGE < 21 AND TXN-AMT > 1500
        MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
    END-IF.
HIGH-RISK-REGION.
    *> LARGE TRANSACTION FROM HIGH-RISK REGION
    IF TXN-AMT > 70000 AND COUNTRY-IS-XC
        MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
        CALL 'FRDALERT' USING WS-INPUT
            ON EXCEPTION CONTINUE
        END-CALL
    END-IF.
